 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Quasi-compact immersions factor through an open and a closed immersion",
 "statement": "Let $h:X\\to Y$ be a quasi-compact immersion of schemes [def-weil-finite-type-morphism]. Then there are a scheme $T$, an open immersion $j:X\\to T$ [def-weil-open-immersion], and a closed immersion $i:T\\to Y$ [def-weil-closed-immersion] such that $h=i\\circ j$.",
